<title>USA: Patriot to invest $300 mln in Hilton venture.</title>
<headline>Patriot to invest $300 mln in Hilton venture.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc will invest about $300 million in its alliance with Hilton Hotels Corp during the next several years, the companies said.</p>
<p>Under terms of the alliance, Patriot will buy four Hilton Suites Hotels, totaling 883 suites, for $104.7 million. It will also develop about 15 new Hilton Garden Inns throughout the U.S. beginning this year.</p>
<p>The two companies will also develop Hilton Suites in new markets and acquire up-scale hotels and convert them to the Hilton brand, the companies said.</p>
</text>
